</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between mt-8 gap-4 px-2">
<p class="text-sm text-[#8a7e60] font-medium">Showing <span class="text-[#181611] dark:text-white">1 to 4</span> of 12 categories</p>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1">
